 "text": "Hello! How's life treating you? Easy. Just put the heavy stuff in the front panniers and the light stuff in the rear. A basket is nice for things you grab quickly, like fruit or a carton of milk. Just keep the basket low down so it' not brushing against anything. It' fine for short trips, but the weight is higher up and you can't get both hands on the handlebars. For longer rides or heavy shopping, panniers are much safer.",
